WEBVTT

00:06:28.916 --> 00:06:32.516
(Applause)

00:06:32.796 --> 00:06:38.436
But our industry is dominated
by a handful of really big consultancies

00:06:38.436 --> 00:06:40.516
and advertising agencies,

00:06:40.516 --> 00:06:44.836
and not one of them
have yet promised to join us.

00:06:45.996 --> 00:06:48.436
And this really matters

00:06:48.436 --> 00:06:53.476
because the X industry is hiring up
many of the most inventive,

00:06:53.476 --> 00:06:54.476
creative,

00:06:54.476 --> 00:06:55.476
knowledgeable

00:06:55.476 --> 00:06:58.196
and influential minds that humanity has.

00:06:58.476 --> 00:07:02.876
And those are the exact
same skills that we need